{"v":4,"catch":"這凍結的世界，等待著新娘（祭品）出現——","desc":"在突然被寒冬冰封的世界『泰多爾』——\n\n獲得了春之女神【祝福】的少女萊蒂西婭，\n為了那些翹首以待春天到來的人們， \n每日都在向神明祈求著救贖。\n\n某日，春之女神終於降臨並告知眾人，\n解決問題的辦法，就是将萊蒂西婭當做【神之新娘】獻給冬之神。\n但這也同時意味着萊蒂西婭身為人類的生命将走向終結。\n\n等待她的究竟會是爛漫的陽春，還是永恆的寒冬？ \n命運的大門，於現在開啟——","publisher":"JOYOLAND","release":"2026-04-30","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔12歳級","size":"Switch 2 1.9GB / Switch 1.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/77774e682c1a1b2ca30a9c526790df88dc07ff80087e512cae92d1a1cb67f3e8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a272c091168d683d9fd82b0f2e0fb3cc1be0994dd594ff40c35d374b1e6a8e3d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e5e8d14ece2f17d62cedd49f50b3941eb827e0b49822eb3733ffb8e24f1b94b6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dc45452b856016612934612d297e660fb4600138170a5c2abeefc4a3e83227d3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5ffc40d3bdde0386597201552521a16db89777ffcc2df93bf5a4af484e1c6849.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/529cd74e097ca6193fee151bcfbcf8f1ca6e9a6e0301f60789fb14ab6d2330c6.jpg"],"titleId":"01009db022bc6000","dlc":[]}